 =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(6{t}^{2}-18t+3) \\\\  & =12t-18\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we put $a=0$ to find the time when the acceleration is zero:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12t-18 & =0 \\\\ t & =\\frac{18}{12} \\\\ t & =\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the acceleration is zero when $t=\\frac{3}{2}.$ To find the velocity at this moment, we substitute this back into $v(t)$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(\\frac{3}{2}) & =6{(\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}-18(\\frac{3}{2})+3 \\\\  & =6(\\frac{9}{4})-27+3 \\\\  & =\\frac{27}{2}-27+3 \\\\  & =-\\frac{21}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399671 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399672 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399671 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399673 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399671 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399674 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399671 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399675 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399671 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399676 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399671 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399671 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399671 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399673 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399671 1080 #uuid "689f3bd0-df18-5a92-92e6-a4a5162ad010" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399672 1081 "t=1,\\,v=\\frac{15}{2}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399672 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399672 1084 #uuid "5103ad76-a94a-5286-8ba5-a77f53f60465" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399673 1081 "t=\\frac{3}{2},\\,v=-\\frac{21}{2}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399673 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399673 1084 #uuid "8436223b-700a-5cfc-999b-c15dd1c4967a" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399674 1081 "t=1,\\,v=-7" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] 