rst column of $P$ is an eigenvector corresponding to $\\lambda =-2.$ \n\nNow, computing $A+2I,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+2I & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 4 & 0 \\\\ -4 & -6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]+2[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 4 & 0 \\\\ -4 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAmong the given vectors, only \n$z$\nis an eigenvector of $A,$ since\n\n$$\n(A+2I)z=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 4 & 0 \\\\ -4 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nand we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\overset{A+2I\\,}{\\to }0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe other vectors do not satisfy this condition." 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399706 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399707 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399706 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399708 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399706 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399709 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399706 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399710 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399706 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399711 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399706 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399706 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399706 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399707 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399706 1080 #uuid "96dde3e3-d566-5414-b2ac-0401b768ea42" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399707 1081 "$z$ only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399707 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399707 1084 #uuid "be97cf6c-4556-5536-81b7-f6cbe24c54a1" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399708 1081 "$x$ and $z$ only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399708 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 1759218604558