d "8d94134c-ec88-57a5-9623-464fd1bd46e5" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399911 1074 "The standard equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}x.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the given equation in standard form, we divide both sides of the equation by $200$ and then simplify, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8{y}^{2}-25{x}^{2} & =200 \\\\ \\frac{8{y}^{2}}{200}-\\frac{25{x}^{2}}{200} & =\\frac{200}{200} \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{25}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{8} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have $a=\\sqrt{25}=5,$ and $b=\\sqrt{8}=2\\sqrt{2}.$\n\nTherefore, the asymptotes of the hyperbola are $y=\\pm \\frac{5}{2\\sqrt{2}}x=\\pm \\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{4}x.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399912 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399913 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399912 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399914 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399912 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399915 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399912 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399916 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399912 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399917 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399912 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399912 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399912 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399915 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399912 1080 #uuid "6c38af93-79cc-5a2c-ab0d-50f123dc3b76" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399913 1081 "y=\\pm \\frac{5}{4}x" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399913 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399913 1084 #uuid "489d92c9-77a7-5316-943d-8961ddbc2299" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399914 1081 "y=\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}x" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399914 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399914 1084 #uuid "0783558f-bd5d-5ab2-b37e-b9fc4fecb054" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399915 1081 "y=\\pm \\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{4}x" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399915 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399915 1084 #uuid "3a6e08ec-dac3-5b7c-b5a5-af8e4b81a049" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399916 1081 "y=\\pm \\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{5}x" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399916 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399916 1084 #uuid "44d093ae-4ed6-57b8-a8f5-a1b5d3c397ba" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399917 1081 "y=\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}x" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399917 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399917 1084 #uuid "f60f0eb5-7238-5210-9677-0ea20e2d26bf" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399918 1068 #edb/ref 17592186399919 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399918 1069 "q-116618" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399918 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399918 1071 "Lisa is selling orange juice. The following table shows the rate, in liters per hour, at which it is sold.\n\n| $t\\,(\\text{hour})$ | $1$ | $2$ | $5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $c(t)\\,(\\text{lts/hour})$ | $3$ | $5$ | $7$ |\n\nUse the trapezoidal rule with the partition\n\n$$\n[1,2]\\cup [2,5],\n$$\n\nto approximate the total number of liters of juice sold by Lisa over a 4 hours period." 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399918 1072 #uuid "ff130200-2cc7-564b-a515-b5f1a6777878" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399918 1074 "In this context, we have $2$ trapezoids, and the area $A$ under the curve $y=c(t)$ represents the total number of liters sold over a $4$ period.\n\nUsing the trapezoidal rule, we estimate the area as follows:\n\n$$\nA≈\\frac{c(1)+c(2)}{2}\\cdot Δ{t}_{1}+\\frac{c(2)+c(5)}{2}\\cdot Δ{t}_{2}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the appropriate numbers into the above expression gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ≈\\frac{3+5}{2}\\cdot (2-1)+\\frac{5+7}{2}\\cdot (5-2) \\\\  & =4\\cdot 1+6\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =22\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, Lisa sold approximately $22\\,\\text{liters}$ over a $4$ hours period." 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399919 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399920 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399919 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399921 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399919 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399922 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399919 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399923 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399919 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399924 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399919 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399919 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399919 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399922 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399919 1080 #uuid "44600354-824b-592c-9161-175c33bd5952" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399920 1081 "$26$ liters" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399920 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399920 1084 #uuid "d5b366ab-ac37-5133-882b-090698ec969f" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399921 1081 "$18$ liters" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399921 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399921 1084 #uuid "8b91a9aa-9d15-594e-aad9-d38bd8e60406" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399922 1081 "$22$ liters" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399922 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399922 1084 #uuid "01b77170-2c7b-5940-82c2-eb220be7de45" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399923 1081 "$32$ liters" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399923 10