er the point $(0,0).$ We note the following:\n\n- The point $(0,0)$ lies on the graph of $y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\\,✓$\n\n- The range of $y=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x$ is $y\\in [-\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\frac{\\pi }{2}],$ and $y=0$ lies within this range. $\\,✓$\n\nTherefore, the point $(0,0)$ does lie on the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x.$\n\n- Finally, we consider the point $(-1,-\\frac{\\pi }{2}).$ We note the following:\n\n- The point $(-\\frac{\\pi }{2},-1)$ lies on the graph of $y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\\,✓$\n\n- The range of $y=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x$ is $y\\in [-\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\frac{\\pi }{2}],$ and $y=-\\frac{\\pi }{2}$ lies within this range. $\\,✓$\n\nTherefore, the point $(-1,-\\frac{\\pi }{2})$ does lie on the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399926 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399927 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399926 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399928 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399926 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399929 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399926 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399930 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399926 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399931 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399926 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399926 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399926 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399928 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399926 1080 #uuid "6e322aae-9a1d-5f87-91ef-3c517a609bae" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399927 1081 "I, II, and III" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399927 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399927 1084 #uuid "c775d264-7add-50d0-9563-a7bc449e39af" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399928 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399928 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399928 1084 #uuid "b0c7aa