n$$\nR(u)=r(0)+u{r}^{′}(0),\\,u\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )\n$$\n\n \n\nFirst, we find $r(0):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(0) & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡({0}^{2}+1),1-5(0)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n   \n\nNow, we calculate ${r}^{′}(t):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡({t}^{2}+1)),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1-5t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{2t}{{t}^{2}+1},-5⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we evaluate ${r}^{′}(t)$ at $t=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(0) & =⟨\\frac{2(0)}{{0}^{2}+1},-5⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,-5⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the tangent line to the given curve at the point where $t=0$ is\n\n$$\nR(u)=⟨0,1⟩+u⟨0,-5⟩,\\,u\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400254 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400255 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400254 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400256 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400254 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400257 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400254 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400258 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400254 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400259 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400254 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400254 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400254 1079 #edb/ref 17592186400257 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400254 1080 #uuid "19d09d6d-fdd3-564f-8577-1f47d907f393" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400255 1081 "⟨0,1⟩+u⟨2,0⟩" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400255 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400255 1084 #uuid "13a35b6d-2cae-582e-8493-f87cca09de5c" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400256 1081 "⟨-1,0⟩+u⟨2,0⟩" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400256 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400256 1084 #uuid "89946061-3179-5a62-92a4-c8e5a2b9e7b8" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] 