(S) & =|\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{7} & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\sqrt{7} & 2 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & \\sqrt{7}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{7}|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{7}\\end{aligned}|-0|\\begin{aligned}-\\sqrt{7} & 0 \\\\ 5 & \\sqrt{7}\\end{aligned}|+\\frac{1}{2}|\\begin{aligned}-\\sqrt{7} & 2 \\\\ 5 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{7}(2\\sqrt{7}-0)-0+\\frac{1}{2}(0-10) \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{7}\\cdot 2\\sqrt{7}+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (-10) \\\\  & =28-5 \\\\  & =23\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(S)=23\\ne 0$, the matrix is **not ** singular. \n\nTherefore, only statement II is true." 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400366 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400367 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400366 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400368 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400366 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400369 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400366 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400370 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400366 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400371 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400366 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400366 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400366 1079 #edb/ref 17592186400371 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400366 1080 #uuid "f4cb87f6-39a9-56d2-9818-a6028ef6c858" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400367 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400367 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400367 1084 #uuid "f0d86b56-15a8-5ce5-87a3-79892a8fcb59" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400368 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400368 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400368 1084 #uuid "72d6cc07-52e5-5150-a7c0-2f37168a2e72" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400369 1081 "I only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400369 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 131941