 the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}0x-8y+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 0x+5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-8y+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400394 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400395 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400394 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400396 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400394 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400397 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400394 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400398 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400394 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400399 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400394 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400394 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400394 1079 #edb/ref 17592186400397 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400394 1080 #uuid "a53c95c7-2729-5853-ad5b-f91dbb44a5b7" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400395 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}-8x+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5x+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6\\end{aligned}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400395 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400395 1084 #uuid "7ef85a9a-8577-56f3-9309-7a0d80e1788e" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400396 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}x-8y+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ x+5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6\\end{aligned}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400396 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400396 1084 #uuid "5972f632-c7f0-561c-8291-df7b2cf33763" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400397 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}-8y+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6\\end{aligned}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [1759218