ctor form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-4y-3 \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400633 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400634 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400635 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400636 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400637 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400632 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400632 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400632 1079 #edb/ref 17592186400634 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400632 1080 #uuid "0a4567f4-6572-5d9e-8018-4068c6812f07" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400633 1081 "No solution" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400633 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400633 1084 #uuid "3d174f1e-8230-59a5-b790-dfbaab4e9521" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400634 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-4y-3 \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400634 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400634 1084 #uuid "244aab6d-90be-578a-8092-166a36c8c9ba" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400635 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}4y+3 \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400635 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400635 1084 #uuid "83dd970a-9032-5161-9210-85e901723065" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186400636 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}4y-3 \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [1759