 missing expression?" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401232 1072 #uuid "d8e5c369-0d01-5527-87a6-9d6d08f8cf0d" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401232 1074 "For a surface $S$ defined by $z=g(x,y)$ with $(x,y)\\in D,$ the surface integral of a scalar function $f(x,y,z)$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂x})}^{2}+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂y})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nFor the partial derivatives, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂z}{∂x}=\\frac{∂}{∂x}(-x+y)=-1,\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂z}{∂y}=\\frac{∂}{∂y}(-x+y)=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂x})}^{2}+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂y})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+{(-1)}^{2}+{(1)}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,{x}^{2}y(-x+y)\\sqrt{3}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\,\\sqrt{3}(-{x}^{3}y+{x}^{2}{y}^{2})\\,\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401233 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401234 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401233 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401235 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401233 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401236 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401233 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401237 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401233 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401238 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401233 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401233 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401233 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401237 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401233 1080 #uuid "bb2d063b-2ed3-5177-a74e-32306bee1975" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401234 1081 "\\sqrt{3}(-{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}{y}^{3})" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401234 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [1