)}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nFrom the repeated integral, we see that the domain of integration $R$ can be written as a type III region as follows:\n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,0\\le z\\le 1,\\,\\,\\sqrt{z}\\le x\\le {e}^{z},\\,\\,{z}^{2}-1\\le y\\le x+z}\n$$\n\nSince all repeated integrals first integrate with respect to $y,$ the $y$-limits remain the same as before:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{\\sqrt{z}}^{{e}^{z}}{\\int }_{{z}^{2}-1}^{x+z}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}z={\\int }_{a}^{b}{\\int }_{{v}_{1}(x)}^{{v}_{2}(x)}{\\int }_{{z}^{2}-1}^{x+z}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{c}^{d}{\\int }_{{v}_{3}(x)}^{{v}_{4}(x)}{\\int }_{{z}^{2}-1}^{x+z}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\n \n\nNow, we consider the projection $D$ of $R$ onto the $xz$-plane shown below.\n\n![](images/41/41b06d98498273a03b9df8eeaa60f4e74cb00168e8dd0b3b395c5b0a23518e57.png)\n\nThe region $D$ is a type II region in the $xz$-plane:\n\n$$\nD={(x,z)\\,:\\,0\\le z\\le 1,\\,\\sqrt{z}\\le x\\le {e}^{z}}.\n$$\n\nTo change the order of integration from $\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}z$ to $\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x,$ we split $D$ into two type I regions.\n\n![](images/07/07a37b90df8b37d07c40af03ecba8e665797cfff368758db7ae17e45f11683cf.png)\n\nNotice that the bottom and top boundaries of the left region, written in the form $z=z(x),$ are\n\n$\\,$ $z=0\\,$ and $\\,z={x}^{2}.$\n\nAlso, the bottom and top boundaries of the right region, written in the form $z=z(x),$ are\n\n$\\,$ $z=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\,$ and $\\,z=1.$\n\nSo, we can write $D$ as a union of\n\n$$\n{D}_{1}={(x,z)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le z\\le {x}^{2}}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n{D}_{2}={(x,z)\\,:\\,1\\le x\\le e,\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\le z\\le 1}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, by swapping the order of integration, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{{x}^{2}}{\\int }_{{z}^{2}-1}^{x+z}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{e}{\\int }_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}^{1}{\\int }_{{z}^{2}-1}^{x+z}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401329 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401330 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401329 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401331 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401329 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401332 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401329 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401333 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401329 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401334 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401329 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401329 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401329 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401333 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401329 1080 #uuid "06475241-fc29-5967-a1f6-50975e64e9e5" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401330 1081 "p={x}^{2},\\,\\,\\,q=2,\\,\\,\\,r=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401330 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401330 1084 #uuid "e986629f-0cb1-5b73-9387-7e5c6bf680ed" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401331 1081 "p=\\sqrt{x},\\,\\,\\,q=e,\\,\\,\\,r=x" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401331 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401331 1084 #uuid "7747ad8c-9dab-5071-9712-612e09ef49ee" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401332 1081 "p=2x,\\,\\,\\,q=2,\\,\\,\\,r={e}^{x}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401332 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401332 1084 #uuid "365f610c-9ced-572c-8125-8961f4f896a9" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401333 1081 "p={x}^{2},\\,\\,\\,q=e,\\,\\,\\,r=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401333 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401333 1084 #uuid "fe0cb55f-4047-582e-8d1c-338eb7a2d14f" 1319413953