123b1" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401534 1081 "A hyperbolic paraboloid" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401534 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401534 1084 #uuid "9e8f1c2e-2ed2-5741-ad54-ce3d99d51afd" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401535 1081 "A hyperbolic cylinder" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401535 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401535 1084 #uuid "d521747d-2c8e-5cb8-b7c2-c2125829bd87" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401536 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401537 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401536 1069 "q-164547" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401536 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401536 1071 "Identify the following surface:\n\n$$\n{y}^{2}=2z,\\,-\\infty <x<\\infty .\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401536 1072 #uuid "50443007-c819-5285-a74f-1d6dfd323e6d" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401536 1074 "Recall that the equation of a parabolic cylinder whose axis is the $z$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}=4py.\n$$\n\nThus, a parabolic cylinder whose axis is the $x$**-axis** is given by\n\n$$\n{y}^{2}=4pz.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation is a parabolic cylinder whose axis is the $x$-axis and $p=\\frac{1}{2}.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401537 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401538 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401537 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401539 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401537 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401540 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401537 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401541 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401537 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401542 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401537 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401537 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401537 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401539 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401537 1080 #uuid "fa665e14-2670-50c6-9aa4-6148466ac38d" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401538 1081 "A hyperbolic cylinder whose axis is the $x$-axis" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401538 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401538 1084 #uuid "ed669204-c56c-5225-aefc-956037ae0d37" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401539 1081 "A parabolic cylinder whose axis is the $x$-axis" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401539 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401539 1084 #uuid "359f70ba-f3cf-563a-9d19-52e3ff5fe27b" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401540 1081 "A parabolic cylinder whose axis is the $y$-axis" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401540 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401540 1084 #uuid "d5285b0d-7ee4-5490-8561-775dea047606" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401541 1081 "An elliptic cone whose axis is the $z$-axis" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401541 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401541 1084 #uuid "74313148-6534-5531-9101-2416622ea616" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401542 1081 "A hyperbolic cylinder whose axis is the $y$-axis" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401542 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401542 1084 #uuid "d9ce9479-a493-554f-88d6-f3b32cbf67e2" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401543 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401544 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401543 1069 "q-16455" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401543 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401543 1071 "What are the lengths of the major and minor axes of an ellipse with equation \n$\\frac{{x}^{2}}{1}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{8}=1?$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401543 1072 #uuid "e791f5b6-5e18-534a-99e5-45cc16c1809f" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401543 1074 "Remember that the equation of an ellipse centered at the origin with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nIn the given equation, we have ${a}^{2}=1$ and ${b}^{2}=8.$\n\n- Since ${a}^{2}=1,$ the length of the horizontal radius must be $a=\\sqrt{1}=1.$\n\n- Since ${b}^{2}=8,$ the length of the vertical radius must be $b=\\sqrt{8}=2\\sqrt{2}.$\n\nSo the semi-major axis has length $b=2\\sqrt{2},$ and the semi-minor axis has length $a=1.$\n\nTherefore, the major axis has length $2b=2\\cdot 2\\sqrt{2}=4\\sqrt{2},$ and the minor axis has length $2a=2\\cdot 1=2.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401544 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401545 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401544 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401546 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401544 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401547 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401544 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401548 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401544 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401549 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401544 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401544 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401544 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401547 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401544 1080 #uuid "b41dd28d-0ca0-5222-9cfe-700ddaa37f17" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401545 1081 "$8$ and $1$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401545 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401545 1084 #uuid "755a881c-6b14-5e96-bd68-6af58d5ef813" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401546 1081 "$2\\sqrt{2}$ and $1$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401546 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401546 1084 #uuid "5965e390-56a0-55ef-a7dc-eff34c09cc53" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401547 1081 "$4\\sqrt{2}$ and $2$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401547 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401547 1084 #uuid "1f629da2-c549-5180-8903-3a78b8767616" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401548 1081 "$4$ and $2$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401548 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401548 1084 #uuid "1c1fc5c2-bdfa-52e9-a59e-c6227d171448" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401549 1081 "$2\\sqrt{2}$ and $2$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401549 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401549 1084 #uuid "47a16fa9-9d49-55d0-a143-c2b6cca5c4dc" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401550 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401551 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401550 1069 "q-164553" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401550 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401550 1071 "Identify the surface $5{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}-5{z}^{2}+20x+10z+15=0.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401550 1072 #uuid "040e9acf-1af9-5813-86f6-e469cb0eecc9" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401550 1074 "First, we complete the square in the $x$ and $z$ terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}-5{z}^{2}+20x+10z+15 & =0 \\\\ 5({x}^{2}+4x)-{y}^{2}-5({z}^{2}-2z)+15 & =0 \\\\ 5[(x+2)^{2}-4]-{y}^{2}-5[(z-1)^{2}-1]+15 & =0 \\\\ 5(x+2)^{2}-20-{y}^{2}-5(z-1)^{2}+5+15 & =0 \\\\ 5(x+2)^{2}-{y}^{2}-5(z-1)^{2} & =0 \\\\ -5(x+2)^{2}+{y}^{2}+5(z-1)^{2} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the equation of an elliptic cone centered at $(-2,0,1).$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401551 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401552 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401551 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401553 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [175921