01803 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401798 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401798 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401798 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401801 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401798 1080 #uuid "1e399198-cdcc-5a53-af6f-9602b7c93771" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401799 1081 "There exists a real number $x$ such that $x+y\\ne 0$ for any real number $y.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401799 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401799 1084 #uuid "6790e841-0c6a-511d-9596-104d0fba6854" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401800 1081 "For all real numbers $x$ and $y,$ $x+y\\ne 0.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401800 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401800 1084 #uuid "87a788ca-e694-5ab2-b2c8-99b2516244ba" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401801 1081 "There exists a real number $x$ such that $x+y=0$ for any real number $y.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401801 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401801 1084 #uuid "9ecf925c-30cf-53ea-8ea6-eb003db73991" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401802 1081 "For all real number $x$ there is another real number $y$ such that $x+y=0.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401802 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401802 1084 #uuid "24715df5-3648-57cf-a0c2-7c8757e47346" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401803 1081 "There are real numbers $x$ and $y$ such that $x+y=0.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401803 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401803 1084 #uuid "5e8dff61-a1b8-558a-96c5-06cbb8e259d4" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401804 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401805 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401804 1069 "q-18688" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401804 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401804 1071 "Find the solution of the following system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}b=2a-1 \\\\ 1.5a+0.5b=2.5\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401804 1072 #uuid "8748ba37-2d9a-5451-b497-621aa22378b8" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401804 1074 "To get rid of the decimals, we multiply the second equation by $10,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}b=2a-1 &  \\\\ 1.5a+0.5b=2.5 & |\\,\\times 10\\end{aligned}\\,⟹\\,{\\begin{aligned}b=2a-1 \\\\ 15a+5b=25\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that the first equation is already solved for $b:$\n\n$$\nb=2a-1\n$$\n\nNow, to find the value of $a,$ we can substitute $b=2a-1$ into the second equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}15a+5(2a-1) & =25 \\\\ 15a+10a-5 & =25 \\\\ 25a & =30 \\\\ a & =\\frac{30}{25} \\\\ a & =1.2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute $a=1.2$ into the  first equation to get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b & =2(1.2)-1 \\\\  & =2.4-1 \\\\  & =1.4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the solution to the system of equations is $a=1.2$ and $b=1.4.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401805 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401806 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401805 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401807 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401805 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401808 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401805 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401809 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401805 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401810 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401805 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401805 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401805 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401808 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401805 1080 #uuid "4994c6c6-b044-5fa6-ae9d-9a350ba14b9d" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401806 1081 "a=0.5,\\,b=-1.4" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401806 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401806 1084 #uuid "c397f249-716c-58ab-a9bf-91bfc3f7d868" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401807 1081 "a=1.5,\\,b=2.4" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401807 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401807 1084 #uuid "2dec0c3e-7449-5041-96b3-12d8ef936e1a" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401808 1081 "a=1.2,\\,b=1.4" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401808 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401808 1084 #uuid "3cc082a1-ed8d-5fbd-b12d-2a2df6063e77" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401809 1081 "a=-1.2,\\,b=0.4" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401809 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401809 1084 #uuid "3da6187f-1bd3-5425-a6fa-9cc0e764d299" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401810 1081 "a=0.2,\\,b=1.7" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401810 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401810 1084 #uuid "ba8550aa-5225-5217-b55a-8b4d6c0d09f1" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401811 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401812 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401811 1069 "q-1913" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401811 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401811 1071 "Find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ if $y=-2{x}^{4}cot⁡x.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401811 1072 #uuid "ee4e083b-fcc9-5eb5-9a27-ac52f9a97afd" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401811 1074 "We calculate the derivative using the product rule, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-2{x}^{4}cot⁡x) \\\\  & =(-8{x}^{3})(cot⁡x)+(-2{x}^{4})(-{csc}^{2}⁡x) \\\\  & =-8{x}^{3}cot⁡x+2{x}^{4}{csc}^{2}