2186401839 1071 "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 4 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401839 1072 #uuid "b5cb76d6-8596-56c0-bf91-5764390c6dbb" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401839 1074 "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401841 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401842 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401843 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401844 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401845 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401843 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1080 #uuid "a8af118b-89c1-56df-aee8-e8ea929b9eb7" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401841 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y-2z=1 \\\\ 3x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401841 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401841 1084 #uuid "7ddbc91f-a2bc-5c20-979a-ce7e906dc06d" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401842 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x-2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401842 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401842 1084 #uuid "ca1394d8-a03f-5e29-aaba-bb0176d8f59b" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401843 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401843 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401843 1084 #uuid "9761f4c8-5981-5fd5-88ce-d6d56601691c" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401844 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401844 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401844 1084 #uuid "13919b67-24a3-5f25-90aa-a16013b5b7e6" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401845 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+y+3z=-2 \\\\ x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401845 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401845 1084 #uuid "2f7be1b8-6206-50f4-9b88-856c8d8e718a" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401846 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401847 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401846 1069 "q-20851" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401846 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401846 1071 "For the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx=2\\sqrt{t},\\,y=12t+1,\\,0\\le t<\\infty ,\n$$\n\n find the derivative $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ at the point $P$ on the curve where $t=1.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401846 1072 #uuid "a11f695c-004e-57f4-b1f5-cd09434f69e2" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401846 1074 "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}},\\,{y}^{′}(t)=12.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{12}{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}}}=12\\sqrt{t}.\n$$\n\nAt the point where $t=1$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =12\\sqrt{1} \\\\  & =12\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401848 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401849 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401850 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401851 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401852 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401848 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1080 #uuid "0ec6f4c2-cef2-5136-bda0-046075ea56a5" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401848 1081 "12" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401848 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401848 1084 #uuid "1e5ec4eb-fb50-5d50-87c7-e15a073c23f5" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401849 1081 "10" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401849 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401849 1084 #uuid "7b15bc55-e6d8-5c21-b55e-568e588591b8" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401850 1081 "3" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401850 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401850 1084 #uuid "2c8c26cd-3204-5045-8920-160928c0068e" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401851 1081 "15" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401851 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401851 1084 #uuid "7828179c-427e-5c33-a7ae-bd0edbe05cfe" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401852 1081 "7" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186401852 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585