 conditions at different points in the domain of $y(x)$ (i.e., at $x=1$ and $x=4$). This is a **boundary value problem.**" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402256 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402257 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402256 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402258 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402256 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402259 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402256 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402260 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402256 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402261 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402256 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402256 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402256 1079 #edb/ref 17592186402259 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402256 1080 #uuid "5e74f1dd-50b5-55df-99cd-c5f3fc2522c6" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402257 1081 "I, II, and III" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402257 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402257 1084 #uuid "8892f2f5-e370-5028-8460-a0e49e8ec9cc" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402258 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402258 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402258 1084 #uuid "88eda162-b9e7-53c5-aaf0-8ab22fd5c91a" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402259 1081 "I only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402259 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402259 1084 #uuid "42ef59eb-cad5-5519-b0d9-e972100a8fd9" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402260 1081 "III only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402260 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402260 1084 #uuid "eddbd1d4-bb8e-5d05-a1f6-e513d4b1a8cd" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402261 1081 "II only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402261 1083 #