e] [17592186402433 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402433 1071 "The level curves of the function $f(x,y)=xy$ are given by $f(x,y)=c.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $c=1$ gives a hyperbola\nII. $c=-1$ gives a parabola\nIII. $c=0$ gives the axes $x=0$ and $y=0$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402433 1072 #uuid "fb8b2d04-67d4-51d3-8ebf-71fc804b1a61" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402433 1074 "Setting $f(x,y)=c$ gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}xy & =c\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore:\n\n- If $c=\\pm 1$ then the level curves are $xy=\\pm 1,$ which are hyperbolas.\n\n- If $c=0$ then the level curves are $xy=0,$ which consists of the axes $x=0$ and $y=0.$\n\nSo, only statements I and III are true." 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402434 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402435 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402434 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402436 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402434 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402437 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402434 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402438 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402434 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402439 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402434 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402434 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402434 1079 #edb/ref 17592186402436 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402434 1080 #uuid "483ba923-28c4-52eb-887b-56bdd19045ab" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402435 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402435 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402435 1084 #uuid "4ccd00e2-e51e-5254-b333-5c31e7370efa" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402436 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402436 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186402436 1084 #uui