 formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=({t}^{3}+3{t}^{2}-1){e}^{t},\\,{y}^{′}(t)=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t}{({t}^{3}+3{t}^{2}-1){e}^{t}}.\n$$\n\nAt the point where $t=0$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡0}{({0}^{3}+3\\cdot {0}^{2}-1){e}^{0}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2(1)}{(-1)\\cdot 1} \\\\  & =-2\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403280 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403281 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403282 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403283 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403284 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403279 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403279 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403279 1079 #edb/ref 17592186403283 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403279 1080 #uuid "cade3433-2a7c-573e-ae14-9f4f0ad1cbde" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403280 1081 "-\\,\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403280 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403280 1084 #uuid "c3b7074a-75b7-5dfa-ba96-9067b0b0c2da" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403281 1081 "-\\,\\frac{1}{2e}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403281 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403281 1084 #uuid "9ca59391-4b16-5de2-b31a-e434042882de" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403282 1081 "-\\,\\frac{e}{2}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403282 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403282 1084 #uuid "b7da2d9