the solution of $-{x}^{2}-2x+3<0.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403369 1072 #uuid "7ab8c812-0c5a-5955-8938-c9f15da2c8e5" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403369 1074 "To solve the inequality \n\n$$\n-{x}^{2}-2x+3<0,\n$$\n\nwe need to find the values of $x$ for which the parabola \n\n$$\ny=-{x}^{2}-2x+3\n$$\n\nlies *below* the $x$-axis.\n\nFirst, let's find the roots of the parabola:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}^{2}-2x+3 & =0 \\\\ -(x-1)(x+3) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the roots are $x=-3$ and $x=1,$ and we can graph the parabola as follows:\n\n![](images/28/289eed0e3b3047987dfbc729d0c22af32d1297ed2fb2d564ec725868b92a39c1.png)\n\nThe values marked in blue show all $x$-values where the parabola lies *below* the axis.\n\nSo, the solution to the inequality is $x<-3$ or $x>1.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403371 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403372 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403373 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403374 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403375 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403370 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403370 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403370 1079 #edb/ref 17592186403371 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403370 1080 #uuid "39da93ce-5e0c-51dc-bb47-cc9906b65efc" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403371 1081 "$x<-3$ or $x>1$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403371 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403371 1084 #uuid "798285f8-4214-5be2-876f-0698e80dc714" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403372 1081 "-3<x<0" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403372 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592