ned}\n$$\n\nso the second point is $(4,0,-9).$\n\nTherefore, the points of intersection are $(2,-6,-11)$ and $(4,0,-9).$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403440 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403441 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403440 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403442 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403440 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403443 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403440 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403444 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403440 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403445 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403440 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403440 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403440 1079 #edb/ref 17592186403443 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403440 1080 #uuid "d05eca42-8651-5c2f-8674-e3ddba6f9f19" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403441 1081 "$(2,6,-1)$ and $(-9,0,4)$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403441 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403441 1084 #uuid "3e899ae8-3cf8-5e18-9992-8c066baf074d" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403442 1081 "$(2,-11,-6)$ and $(4,9,0)$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403442 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403442 1084 #uuid "0c7902d4-3d6b-5d79-952e-dcac32641631" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403443 1081 "$(2,-6,-11)$ and $(4,0,-9)$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403443 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403443 1084 #uuid "08bd5955-d373-56ba-baf4-1aadf1fb7896" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403444 1081 "$(6,-2,-11)$ and $(0,4,-9)$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403444 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403444 1084 #uuid "ec7ff1f0-3878-5b9b-a5fe-0551578c7ac3" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403445 1081 "$(1,-