& =(-4(\\frac{1}{2})-1)\\,i-4(1)\\text{ }j+k \\\\  & =-3\\,i-4\\,j+k \\\\  & =⟨-3,-4,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the vector equation of the line that is parallel to $∇f(\\frac{1}{2},1,3)$ and passes through the point $(\\frac{1}{2},1,3)$ can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =⟨\\frac{1}{2},1,3⟩+t\\,∇f(\\frac{1}{2},1,3)=⟨\\frac{1}{2},1,3⟩+t\\,⟨-3,-4,1⟩,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403475 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403476 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403475 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403477 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403475 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403478 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403475 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403479 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403475 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403480 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403475 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403475 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403475 1079 #edb/ref 17592186403480 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403475 1080 #uuid "3a86f3ea-971f-5c0c-ab0d-7a86359ca0e2" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403476 1081 "r=⟨-3,-4,1⟩+t\\,⟨\\frac{1}{2},1,3⟩" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403476 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403476 1084 #uuid "74e84be6-fb21-5888-bde0-2b1fc8861800" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403477 1081 "r=⟨3,-4,1⟩+t\\,⟨\\frac{1}{2},1,3⟩" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403477 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403477 1084 #uuid "125b86ba-8a17-5cc7-bb9b-688c88040c9a" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403478 1081 "r=⟨\\frac{1}{2},1,3⟩+t\\,⟨3,4,1⟩" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403478 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403478 1084 #uuid "a563a551-487d-52b0-b121-65d93d53f35f" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403479 1081 "r=⟨\\frac{1}{2},1,3⟩+t\\,⟨3,-4,1⟩" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403479 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403479 1084 #uuid "74e61dbd-b0b0-51fb-aee1-a797c08c8fb2" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403480 1081 "r=⟨\\frac{1}{2},1,3⟩+t\\,⟨-3,-4,1⟩" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403480 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403480 1084 #uuid "65d0bd41-c0f7-5813-a9d5-53b92a3b0d8a" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403481 1068 #edb/ref 17592186403482 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403481 1069 "q-71474" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403481 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403481 1071 "Given that $f(x,y,z)=\\frac{1}{xy}+\\frac{1}{y}+\\frac{1}{zx}-z$, find the points $(x,y,z)$ where $∇f(x,y,z)=0.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403481 1072 #uuid "c503ae86-f71f-5a21-9c90-e19ce4d410a1" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403481 1074 "First, we find the partial derivatives: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\frac{1}{xy}+\\frac{1}{y}+\\frac{1}{zx}-z) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}y}+0-\\frac{1}{z{x}^{2}}-0 \\\\  & =-\\frac{z+y}{{x}^{2}yz} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{1}{xy}+\\frac{1}{y}+\\frac{1}{zx}-z) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{x{y}^{2}}-\\frac{1}{{y}^{2}}+0-0 \\\\  & =-\\frac{1+x}{x{y}^{2}} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z} & =\\frac{∂}{∂z}(\\frac{1}{xy}+\\frac{1}{y}+\\frac{1}{zx}-z) \\\\  & =0+0-\\frac{1}{{z}^{2}x}-1 \\\\  & =-\\frac{1+{z}^{2}x}{{z}^{2}x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, $∇f(x,y,z)=-\\frac{z+y}{{x}^{2}yz}\\,i-\\frac{1+x}{x{y}^{2}}\\,j-\\frac{1+{z}^{2}x}{{z}^{2}x}\\,k.$ \n\nNow, we solve $∇f(x,y,z)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{z+y}{{x}^{2}yz}\\,i-\\frac{1+x}{x{y}^{2}}\\,j-\\frac{1+{z}^{2}x}{{z}^{2}x}\\,k & =0\\text{ }i+0\\text{ }j+0\\text{ }j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, by equating the coefficient of $i$, $j$, and $k$, we obtain:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{z+y}{{x}^{2}yz}=0 \\\\ -\\frac{1+x}{x{y}^{2}}=0 \\\\ -\\frac{1+{z}^{2}x}{{z}^{2}x}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation, we get $x=-1.$ Substituting these into the third equation, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1+{z}^{2}x}{{z}^{2}x} & =0 \\\\ -\\frac{1+{z}^{2}(-1)}{{z}^{2}(-1)} & =0 \\\\ 1-{z}^{2} & =0 \\\\ {z}^{2} & =1 \\\\ z & =\\pm 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=-1$ into the first equation, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{z+y}{(-1)^{2}yz} & =0 \\\\ z+y & =0 \\\\ y & =-z\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhen $z=1,$ we have $y=-1$ and when $z=-1,$ we have $y=1.$\n\nHence, $∇f(x,y,z)=0$ at two points: $(-1,-1,1)$ and $(-1,1,-1).$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403482 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403483 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403482 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403484 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403482 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403485 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403482 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403486 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403482 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403487 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403482 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403482 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403482 1079 #edb/ref 17592186403485 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403482 1080 #uuid "ca042fa0-0bbe-58d3-8050-de243a925b8d" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403483 1081 "$(-1,-1,1)$ only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403483 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403483 1084 #uuid "c9ec4597-899c-5f21-a16c-2695e9541e21" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403484 1081 "$(-1,-1,-1)$ and $(-1,1,1)$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403484 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403484 1084 #uuid "4c24ba4d-0c93-5d33-a565