403898 1072 #uuid "19042bce-c915-5186-a2d2-3f28f8435edc" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403898 1074 "To find the image of $\\overset{―}{AB}$ under the action of $T$, we first create a matrix $X$ containing the coordinates of the endpoints of $\\overset{―}{AB}:$\n\n$$\nX=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under the action of $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective endpoints of the image are ${A}^{′}(2,1)$ and ${B}^{′}(1,-3).$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403899 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403900 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403899 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403901 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403899 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403902 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403899 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403903 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403899 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403904 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403899 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403899 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403899 1079 #edb/ref 17592186403900 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403899 1080 #uuid "a377066a-f0ff-5175-8fb9-ad480e6de6b2" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403900 1081 "$(2,1)$ and $(1,-3)$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403900 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403900 1084 #uuid "2493e3b1-7ae0-5501-828a-88fedefa33a9" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403901 1081 "$(2,-1)$ and $(1,-3)$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403901 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186403901 1084 #uuid "19d3cf9c-194c-5