e expand the brackets, and write the equation in the required form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{(w-5)}^{2}-4\\cdot 25 & =-75 \\\\ 4{(w-5)}^{2}-100 & =-75 \\\\ 4{(w-5)}^{2} & =-75+100 \\\\ 4{(w-5)}^{2} & =25\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $q=25.$ We now solve the equation using the square root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{(w-5)}^{2} & =25 \\\\ {(w-5)}^{2} & =\\frac{25}{4} \\\\ \\sqrt{{(w-5)}^{2}} & =\\sqrt{\\frac{25}{4}} \\\\ |w-5| & =\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ w-5 & =\\pm \\frac{5}{2} \\\\ w & =5\\pm \\frac{5}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe simplify the two solutions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}w & =5+\\frac{5}{2}=\\frac{15}{2} \\\\ w & =5-\\frac{5}{2}=\\frac{5}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $w=\\frac{5}{2}$ and $w=\\frac{15}{2}.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404350 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404351 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404350 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404352 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404350 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404353 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404350 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404354 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404350 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404355 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404350 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404350 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404350 1079 #edb/ref 17592186404351 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404350 1080 #uuid "417df0a0-d7e8-5502-826d-e0777e84a95f" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404351 1081 "$q=25,\\,w=\\frac{5}{2}$ and $w=\\frac{15}{2}$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404351 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404351 1084 #uuid "c07dfad2-047a-527a-a51a-4f998f1949f6" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404352 1081 "$q=15,\\,w=-\\frac{5}{2}$ and $w=\\frac{15}{2}$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404352 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true]