e $P(A\\cap B)$ using the addition law:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(A\\cup B) & =P(A)+P(B)-P(A\\cap B) \\\\ \\frac{19}{40} & =\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{3}{10}-P(A\\cap B) \\\\ P(A\\cap B) & =\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{3}{10}-\\frac{19}{40} \\\\  & =\\frac{10+12-19}{40} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{40} \\\\  & \\ne 0\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $A$ and $B$ are not mutually exclusive events." 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404392 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404393 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404392 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404394 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404392 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404395 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404392 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404396 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404392 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404397 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404392 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404392 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404392 1079 #edb/ref 17592186404396 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404392 1080 #uuid "c7ba2dd8-2220-580b-91e1-140112b524be" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404393 1081 "$A$ and $B$ are not mutually exclusive events, since $P(A)\\cdot P(B)\\ne P(A\\cup B)$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404393 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404393 1084 #uuid "2a7fb06d-1012-5494-b8ed-015056975eb4" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404394 1081 "$A$ and $B$ are mutually exclusive events, since $P(A\\cap B)=0$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404394 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404394 1084 #uuid "12b1de4e-720b-5103-b02a-93df60a43fdc" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404395 1081 "$A$ and $B$ are not mutually exclusive events, since $P(A)\\cdot P(B)<P(A\\cup B)$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404395 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404395 1084 #uuid "4cdbc724-6263-5eb1-9f31-2c494f2f3956" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404396 1081 "$A$ and $B$ are not mutually exclusive events, since $P(A\\cap B)\\ne 0$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404396 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404396 1084 #uuid "31a10f8b-ef54-5e35-b68f-279c0bb07e32" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404397 1081 "$A$ and $B$ are not mutually exclusive events, since $P(A)\\ne P(B)$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404397 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404397 1084 #uuid "88f3e987-8871-5966-8f22-ab50bf9c636c" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404398 1068 #edb/ref 17592186404399 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404398 1069 "q-87305" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404398 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404398 1071 "Suppose that $A$ and $B$ are mutually exclusive events. Given that $P(B)=\\frac{1}{15}$ and $P(A\\cup B)=\\frac{3}{5},$ find $P(A).$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404398 1072 #uuid "1e20e394-569b-5fe6-8d7e-276b93ef613e" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404398 1074 "If $A$ and $B$ are mutually exclusive events, then $P(A\\cap B)=0.$ \n\nTherefore, by the addition law, we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(A\\cup B) & =P(A)+P(B) \\\\ P(A) & =P(A\\cup B)-P(B) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{5}-\\frac{1}{15} \\\\  & =\\frac{9-1}{15} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{15}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404399 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404400 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404399 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404401 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404399 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404402 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404399 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404403 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404399 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404404 1319