1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404439 1071 "Solve the inequality $-{9}^{2x-4}{x}^{2}<-5\\cdot {9}^{2x-4}-7\\cdot {9}^{2x-4}.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404439 1072 #uuid "99779233-4022-57ea-8b13-fcf906c4aeff" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404439 1074 "First, we move all the terms to the left side of the inequality and factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{9}^{2x-4}{x}^{2} & <-5\\cdot {9}^{2x-4}-7\\cdot {9}^{2x-4} \\\\ -{9}^{2x-4}{x}^{2}+5\\cdot {9}^{2x-4}+7\\cdot {9}^{2x-4} & <0 \\\\ (-{x}^{2}+5+7){9}^{2x-4} & <0 \\\\ (12-{x}^{2}){9}^{2x-4} & <0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we divide both sides by ${9}^{2x-4}$ and solve the resulting inequality using familiar techniques:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12-{x}^{2} & <0 \\\\ -{x}^{2} & <-12 \\\\ {x}^{2} & >12 \\\\ \\sqrt{{x}^{2}} & >\\sqrt{12} \\\\ |x| & >2\\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution to the inequality above is $x<-2\\sqrt{3}$ or $x>2\\sqrt{3}.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404440 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404441 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404440 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404442 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404440 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404443 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404440 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404444 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404440 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404445 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404440 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404440 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404440 1079 #edb/ref 17592186404443 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404440 1080 #uuid "b2157a1d-8075-5da7-8704-cf68a742b357" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404441 1081 "x>\\sqrt{3}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404441 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404441 1084 #uuid "4466cd39-9e73-567d-823b-c399bff02272" 13194139533478 175921860