ivative equal to zero, and solve for $x$ by completing the square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{{x}^{2}-6x+5}{({x}^{2}-5)^{2}} & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-6x+5 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-2\\cdot 3x+{3}^{2}-{3}^{2}+5 & =0 \\\\ (x-3)^{2}-9+5 & =0 \\\\ (x-3)^{2}-4 & =0 \\\\ (x-3)^{2} & =4 \\\\ x-3 & =\\pm 2 \\\\ x & =1,\\,5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)$ has stationary points at $x=1$ and $x=5.$\n\n- Second, we note that ${f}^{′}(x)$ does not exist at $x=\\pm \\sqrt{5}.$ But these points do not lie in the domain of $f(x).$ So $f(x)$ has no non-stationary critical points.\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the critical points of $f(x)$ are $x=1$ and $x=5.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404995 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404996 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404995 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404997 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404995 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404998 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404995 1075 #edb/ref 17592186404999 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404995 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405000 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404995 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404995 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404995 1079 #edb/ref 17592186405000 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404995 1080 #uuid "25281d74-3b09-5c83-b4d4-d24247da42a5" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404996 1081 "$x=3$ only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404996 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404996 1084 #uuid "3099f3c2-846b-5ae3-b13d-62bf2853c8e6" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404997 1081 "$x=1$ only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404997 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404997 1084 #uuid "80bf0b4b-0794-5476-96ae-6da113dacb97" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186404998 1081 "$x=3$ and $x=\\sqrt{5}$" 13194139533478 17592186